Go Gopher 캐릭터 팩 (cli-pet)
================================

권리자 / 원작자
  Go Gopher 디자인: Renée French (http://reneefrench.blogspot.com/)
  이미지 배포: The Go Authors (go.dev, github.com/golang/website)

